# Keep build context small and keep secrets out of it.
#
# `.env` is listed FIRST and deliberately: a developer's real provider keys must never reach an image
# layer, and an ignore file is the only thing standing between a local `.env` and a published image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
.git
.github
.hoplite
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
